# Scheduling Logic

Slots are NOT stored in database.

Slots are generated dynamically from:

* working days
* opening/closing hours
* breaks
* duration
* existing appointments

Flow:

1. generate possible slots
2. remove occupied slots
3. remaining = available slots

Much cleaner and scalable.

---

# Security (Important)

RLS enabled on all tables.

Patients:

* only see/manage their own appointments/favorites

Doctors:

* only manage their own profile/appointments

Public:

* only browse active doctors

